<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Project J</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>

  <main class="card">
    <p class="tag">PROJECT J / 001</p>

    <h1 id="heading">Jazz.</h1>

    <p id="intro">
      Can I tell you something?
      Don't worry, it's not that deep.
      Well… maybe a little.
    </p>

    <button id="openBtn">Okay, tell me? ↗</button>

    <section id="letter" class="hidden">
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE HONESTY</p>

      <h2>Okay, real talk.</h2>

      <p>
        Medyo random 'to, pero gustong gusto ko na talagang sabihin sayo ito.
      </p>

      <p>
        I think you're really interesting, and honestly,
        <strong>I kinda like you.</strong>
        Hindi ko naman gustong gawing big deal 'to
        or make things awkward between us.
        I just thought na instead of keeping it to myself,
        why not be honest about it?
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm not expecting you to feel the same way,
        and I'm not trying to rush anything.
        I just wanna get to know you better, talk to you
        more, and see where things go naturally.
      </p>

      <p>
        So yeah, that's pretty much it.
        No dramatic confession, no pressure,
        just me being real with you.
      </p>

      <p class="confession">
        I like you, Jazzliane.
        That's the surprise.
      </p>

      <p>
        And if you happen to feel the same way,
        well… I'd be happy to know. :)
      </p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h2>So, what do you think?</h2>

      <p class="small">
        No pressure. Just answer honestly.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <button id="yesBtn">i love it :)</button>
        <button id="thinkBtn" class="secondary">
          Let me think
        </button>
      </div>

      <p id="response" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <footer>JUST KEEPING IT REAL.</footer>
  </main>

</body>
</html>
